schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-map-sunken-market
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Top-down dungeon map of the Sunken Market — Zone 2 of Echo of Manifestation, a survival horror
    roguelite. Dark fantasy game design document style, bird's-eye architectural floor plan.

    The map shows a flooded bazaar complex with these rooms connected by submerged shadow corridors:

    ENTRY (north): A drainage tunnel entrance from Zone 1's threshold corridor. Water level at ankle
    depth. A small landing platform with a resonance shrine.

    FLOODED STALLS — COMBAT (center-north): 22m x 16m. Waist-deep murky water fills a ruined
    marketplace. Collapsed stall awnings create islands of walkable terrain drawn as raised platforms.
    Two essence nodes: atop a floating stall platform, submerged in southeast corner. Three shadow
    nodes: underwater along eastern wall, beneath collapsed awning, inside a sunken cart. Water depth
    zones marked with blue-tinted gradient fills (ankle-deep light blue, waist-deep medium blue,
    chest-deep dark blue). Contaminated water hazard borders marked with amber warning lines.

    TIDE-LOCKED VAULT — PUZZLE (west): 10m x 10m. A merchant's strongroom with three drainage valves
    marked as large wheel icons. Water level indicators showing staged drainage. One essence node
    revealed only after full drainage at floor center. Two shadow nodes behind valve mechanisms. Flood
    hazard zone marked around incorrect valve paths.

    DROWNED WAREHOUSE — LOOT (east): 18m x 12m. Tilting warehouse structure drawn at a slight angle.
    Half-submerged crate clusters. Chain hoists marked as vertical lines connecting upper shelving to
    ceiling. Office room in the corner with a safe icon. Three essence nodes: office safe, top shelf
    cluster, submerged crate stack. One shadow node inside a sealed crate. A TIME DILATION POCKET
    inside the office behind a false wall panel.

    SMUGGLER'S SUMP — SECRET (south, accessible via underwater grate in Flooded Stalls): 8m x 14m
    hidden drainage tunnel drawn with dashed border. Dry ledges line the walls above waterline.
    Contraband crate icons on the ledges. Two essence nodes: behind false crate wall, under water at
    north end. Two shadow nodes on submerged ledges. Tide surge hazard zones marked with periodic
    wave symbols. Shortcut icon indicating passage to Zone 3.

    AUCTION HOUSE RUIN — BOSS (south): 24m x 18m grand auction hall flooded to knee height. Raised
    auction podium island at center. Tiered seating creating elevation contours. Three essence nodes:
    podium, west balcony, east seating tier. Five shadow nodes: underwater throughout seating, under
    podium, behind stage curtain. Water level mechanics shown with rising/falling water indicators.
    A TIME DILATION POCKET behind the auction stage. Boss marker: "BLIGHT MOTHER" at podium with a
    fungal-growth skull icon.

    THRESHOLD SHRINE (south exit): Beyond the boss arena, threshold corridor with zone gate.

    Water flow arrows throughout the map showing current direction. Rising water level mechanic shown
    with gradient zones that shift between runs. Stall rearrangement indicators (dashed alternate
    positions for stall platforms). Amber growth patches marked as sickly amber spots along walls.

    Map legend: Amber diamond = Essence Node, Purple circle = Shadow Node, Golden bubble = Time
    Dilation Pocket, Dashed border = Secret Room, Skull icon = Boss, Wave symbol = Rising Water
    Hazard, Blue gradient = Water Depth.

    Style: Architectural blueprint on dark teal-tinted background. Room walls in tarnished copper
    lines with murky teal wash. Water rendered as translucent blue-gray overlays. Bioluminescent
    teal accents at shadow node positions. Professional game design document aesthetic.
  negative: "bright colors, cartoon, anime, 3D rendered, photorealistic, clean water, tropical, bright blue water, cheerful, low detail, messy"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"

tags: [map, zone-2, sunken-market, top-down, dungeon-map, game-design-document, dark-fantasy, flooded]
